{"nodes": [{"id": "ref_bootcamp_mvp_process", "label": ".claude/rules/bootcamp-mvp-process.md (\u0645\u064a\u062b\u0627\u0642 \u0627\u0644\u0639\u0645\u0644 \u0627\u0644\u062f\u0627\u0626\u0645)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "project-package/.claude/rules/bootcamp-mvp-process.md", "source_location": "L1-150", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "bootcamp_mvp_process_charter", "label": "\u0645\u064a\u062b\u0627\u0642 \u0627\u0644\u0639\u0645\u0644 \u2014 \u0643\u064a\u0641 \u0623\u062a\u0635\u0631\u0651\u0641 \u062f\u0627\u0626\u0645\u064b\u0627", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "project-package/.claude/rules/bootcamp-mvp-process.md", "source_location": "L3-9", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Loaded in full on every message so it stays short; audience is Claude only, the trainee never reads it. Says HOW to behave always; WHO/WHERE lives in CLAUDE.md, per-section execution in skills."}, {"id": "bootcamp_mvp_process_file_contract", "label": "\u0639\u0642\u062f \u0627\u0644\u0645\u0644\u0641\u0627\u062a \u2014 \u0643\u0644 \u0645\u0644\u0641 \u064a\u062c\u064a\u0628 \u0639\u0646 \u0633\u0624\u0627\u0644 \u0648\u0627\u062d\u062f", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "project-package/.claude/rules/bootcamp-mvp-process.md", "source_location": "L11-22", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Prevents content duplication between files: never write in one file what belongs to another."}, {"id": "bootcamp_mvp_process_state_vs_history", "label": "PRODUCT.md (\u0627\u0644\u062d\u0627\u0644\u0629 \u0627\u0644\u0622\u0646) \u0645\u0642\u0627\u0628\u0644 conversation_history.md (\u0643\u064a\u0641 \u0648\u0635\u0644\u0646\u0627)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "project-package/.claude/rules/bootcamp-mvp-process.md", "source_location": "L24", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "bootcamp_mvp_process_deliberate_redundancy", "label": "\u0627\u0644\u062a\u0643\u0631\u0627\u0631 \u0627\u0644\u0645\u0642\u0635\u0648\u062f \u2014 \u0635\u064a\u063a \u0627\u0644\u0645\u0637\u0627\u0644\u0628\u0627\u062a \u0641\u064a \u0645\u0648\u0636\u0639\u064a\u0646", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "project-package/.claude/rules/bootcamp-mvp-process.md", "source_location": "L26-33", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Prompt templates live in both the skill and the trainee-facing material so work continues even if Claude fails and the trainee can be explicit; never 'clean it up'."}, {"id": "bootcamp_mvp_process_history_protocol", "label": "\u0628\u0631\u0648\u062a\u0648\u0643\u0648\u0644 \u0633\u062c\u0644\u0651 \u0627\u0644\u0645\u062d\u0627\u062f\u062b\u0629", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "project-package/.claude/rules/bootcamp-mvp-process.md", "source_location": "L35-64", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "bootcamp_mvp_process_history_file", "label": "conversation_history.md \u2014 \u0630\u0627\u0643\u0631\u0629 \u0627\u0644\u0645\u0634\u0631\u0648\u0639 \u0627\u0644\u062f\u0627\u0626\u0645\u0629", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "project-package/.claude/rules/bootcamp-mvp-process.md", "source_location": "L35-37", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Survives context-window limits, session restarts and model switches; a new session reads it to restore context."}, {"id": "mvp_process_rule_per_message_history_cycle", "label": "\u0627\u0644\u062f\u0648\u0631\u0629 \u0627\u0644\u0625\u0644\u0632\u0627\u0645\u064a\u0629 \u0641\u064a \u0643\u0644 \u0631\u0633\u0627\u0644\u0629: \u0623\u0646\u0634\u0626 \u2190 \u0645\u0637\u0627\u0644\u0628\u0629 \u2190 \u0631\u062f\u0651 \u0643\u0627\u0645\u0644 \u2190 \u0623\u0633\u0637\u0631 \u062f\u0631\u062f\u0634\u0629", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "project-package/.claude/rules/bootcamp-mvp-process.md", "source_location": "L39-48", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "File first, chat second: whoever writes chat first ends up abbreviating the file, which corrupts the log."}, {"id": "mvp_process_rule_file_longer_than_chat_test", "label": "\u0627\u062e\u062a\u0628\u0627\u0631 \u0627\u0644\u0645\u062e\u0627\u0644\u0641\u0629: \u0645\u0627 \u0641\u064a \u0627\u0644\u0645\u0644\u0641 \u0623\u0637\u0648\u0644 \u0645\u0646 \u0627\u0644\u062f\u0631\u062f\u0634\u0629 \u062f\u0627\u0626\u0645\u064b\u0627", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "project-package/.claude/rules/bootcamp-mvp-process.md", "source_location": "L50-56", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Chat is the pointer, the file is the copy; if chat is longer the rule was violated. If the trainee has to ask to document it, Claude forgot."}, {"id": "bootcamp_mvp_process_secrets_exception", "label": "\u0627\u0633\u062a\u062b\u0646\u0627\u0621 \u0627\u0644\u0623\u0633\u0631\u0627\u0631 \u0627\u0644\u0625\u0644\u0632\u0627\u0645\u064a \u2014 \u0627\u0643\u062a\u0628 <\u062a\u0645 \u0627\u0633\u062a\u0644\u0627\u0645 \u0627\u0644\u0645\u0641\u062a\u0627\u062d>", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "project-package/.claude/rules/bootcamp-mvp-process.md", "source_location": "L66", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "'Document everything' does not include keys or passwords."}, {"id": "bootcamp_mvp_process_default_stack", "label": "\u0627\u0644\u062d\u0632\u0645\u0629 \u0627\u0644\u062a\u0642\u0646\u064a\u0629 \u0627\u0644\u0627\u0641\u062a\u0631\u0627\u0636\u064a\u0629 \u2014 Next.js \u0648\u0627\u062d\u062f + Supabase + Vercel", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "project-package/.claude/rules/bootcamp-mvp-process.md", "source_location": "L68-81", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "mvp_process_rule_application_folder", "label": "\u0643\u0644 \u0643\u0648\u062f \u0627\u0644\u0645\u0634\u0631\u0648\u0639 \u062f\u0627\u062e\u0644 application/ \u2014 \u0644\u0627 app/ \u0648\u0644\u0627 \u0627\u0644\u062c\u0630\u0631", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "project-package/.claude/rules/bootcamp-mvp-process.md", "source_location": "L73-77", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Frameworks like Next.js generate their own app/ folder, so naming it app/ yields app/app/ and confuses everyone; applies whatever the language; if split, application/frontend and application/backend; docs and .claude stay at root."}, {"id": "mvp_process_rule_trainee_does_accounts_only", "label": "\u0645\u0627 \u064a\u0639\u0645\u0644\u0647 \u0627\u0644\u0645\u062a\u062f\u0631\u0651\u0628 \u064a\u062f\u0648\u064a\u064b\u0627 = \u062d\u0633\u0627\u0628\u0627\u062a\u0647 \u0648\u0645\u0641\u0627\u062a\u064a\u062d\u0647 \u0641\u0642\u0637", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "project-package/.claude/rules/bootcamp-mvp-process.md", "source_location": "L80", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "mvp_process_rule_two_part_reply", "label": "\u0631\u062f\u0651 \u0628\u0642\u0633\u0645\u064a\u0646: \u00ab\u0644\u0643 \u0623\u0646\u062a\u00bb \u062b\u0645 \u00ab\u062a\u0641\u0627\u0635\u064a\u0644 \u062a\u0642\u0646\u064a\u0629 \u2014 \u0644\u0627 \u064a\u0644\u0632\u0645\u0643 \u0642\u0631\u0627\u0621\u062a\u0647\u0627\u00bb", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "project-package/.claude/rules/bootcamp-mvp-process.md", "source_location": "L85-106", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Trainee only cares what works now, how to see it, and the next step; how Claude got there is the engineer's detail. Applies to chat summary, full reply in history, and plan-mode plan; the extra length in the file lives in part two."}, {"id": "mvp_process_rule_list_all_routes", "label": "\u0627\u0633\u0631\u062f \u0643\u0644 \u0627\u0644\u0645\u0633\u0627\u0631\u0627\u062a \u0627\u0644\u0645\u0646\u062a\u064e\u062c\u0629 \u0648\u0627\u062d\u062f\u064b\u0627 \u0648\u0627\u062d\u062f\u064b\u0627 \u0628\u0648\u0635\u0641 \u0642\u0635\u064a\u0631", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "project-package/.claude/rules/bootcamp-mvp-process.md", "source_location": "L92", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "mvp_process_rule_rtl_wrapper", "label": "\u0643\u0644 \u0645\u062e\u0631\u064e\u062c \u0639\u0631\u0628\u064a\u0651 \u064a\u064f\u063a\u0644\u064e\u0651\u0641 \u0628\u0640 div dir=rtl", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "project-package/.claude/rules/bootcamp-mvp-process.md", "source_location": "L108-112", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Without it numbered/bulleted lists render with numbers on the left; the place most often forgotten is the plan-mode plan."}, {"id": "mvp_process_rule_no_latin_line_start", "label": "\u0644\u0627 \u062a\u0641\u062a\u062a\u062d \u0633\u0637\u0631\u064b\u0627 \u0628\u0646\u0635\u0651 \u0644\u0627\u062a\u064a\u0646\u064a (FR-1\u060c EARS)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "project-package/.claude/rules/bootcamp-mvp-process.md", "source_location": "L116", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The renderer picks paragraph direction from the first strong character, so a Latin-first line flips fully to the left."}, {"id": "mvp_process_rule_br_line_breaks", "label": "\u0627\u0644\u0623\u0633\u0637\u0631 \u0627\u0644\u0645\u062a\u062a\u0627\u0628\u0639\u0629 \u062a\u064f\u062f\u0645\u062c \u2014 \u0623\u063a\u0644\u0642 \u0643\u0644 \u0633\u0637\u0631 \u0628\u0640 br", "file_type": 